{
  "$schema": "../node_modules/@stryker-mutator/core/schema/stryker-schema.json",
  "mutate": [
    "packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/server/store/**/*.ts",
    "packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/server/stats/**/*.ts",
    "!packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/client/**",
    "!packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/**/interface.ts",
    "!packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/server/*/deps.ts",
    "!packages/dsh-mcp-manager/src/server/*/*/deps.ts"
  ],
  "testRunner": "vitest",
  "mutator": {
    "excludedMutations": [
      "StringLiteral",
      "ArrayLiteral",
      "ObjectLiteral",
      "TemplateLiteral"
    ]
  },
  "plugins": [
    "@stryker-mutator/vitest-runner"
  ],
  "concurrency": 16,
  "timeoutMS": 60000,
  "dryRunTimeoutMinutes": 5,
  "reporters": [
    "progress",
    "clear-text",
    "json"
  ],
  "coverageAnalysis": "perTest",
  "tempDirName": ".stryker-tmp",
  "cleanTempDir": true,
  "vitest": {
    "related": false,
    "configFile": "vitest.stryker.d/dsh-mcp-manager.config.ts"
  },
  "jsonReporter": {
    "fileName": "coverage/mutation/dsh-mcp-manager-supervisor.json"
  },
  "incremental": true,
  "incrementalFile": "coverage/mutation/incremental-mcp-manager-supervisor.json",
  "_comment": "#767 B2b 重画：supervisor——状态持久化（store）+统计（stats）；B2b 后文件归各域段。段名保留（段只是 glob 容器，ID 还绑着 stryker.conf.d 的 jsonReporter/incremental 与 mutation-segment-ledger）：#767 S1-5c 删自研连接栈后，原连接监督器与重连策略两条 glob（runtime/supervisor.ts+runtime/reconnect.ts）已是 0 命中死条目，随本刀删除，不再换新落点——本笔没有新增源文件，段名退役会连带 baseline-archive 段数哨兵 + ledger superseded + AGENTS.md 三处。W11b2a 删除 src/types 与 src/integration 后，原两条排除已成 0 命中死条目，随本刀删除；excludes 仅保留 client 一条（另一端）。测试全套跑（perTest 关联）；incremental 基线随 observe 夜间全量班重建（D7 迁移豁免）。"
}
